Hi Urtzi,

Good spotting. 1) they should be deleted 2) the leopard frog-specific relation was indeed being overridden by the more general approximation for a sphere.

I'll remove the redundant code and keep it functioning as is. But of course you can change this yourself to see if the leopard frog Nusselt number is a better predictor for a particular case.

All the best,
Mike

